{"id": "121511", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=121511", "title": "Tulungagung", "text": "Tulungagung is a regency in East Java, on the south coast about 154 km southwest of the capital Surabaya. It is known as one of the largest marble-producing areas in Indonesia.\nGet in.\nBy car.\nFrom Kediri go to the south for 35 km or an hour away drive.\nGet around.\nIt is more flexible to go to the tourist attractions by car or motorbike.\nBuy.\nBuy the marble craft.\nDrink.\nTry kopi ijo, a coffee drink blended with mung bean powder.\nConnect.\nThe dialing code for Tulungagung is 0355."}
